      "id": 1,
      "text": "Ankeny was founded as an agrarian community on April 22, 1875, by John Fletcher Ankeny and his wife Sarah on 80 acres purchased July 11, 1874.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
