      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "A narrow‑gauge railroad ran through Ankeny in 1874, connecting Des Moines to Ames, and was later converted to wide gauge by the Chicago‑Northwestern in 1879.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
