      ],
      "source": "https://www.ankenyiowa.gov/432/History",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1947, Deere & Company bought the local factory, turning it into the John Deere Des Moines Works that still produces agricultural equipment today.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ankeny%2C_Iowa",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The new Kirkendall Public Library opened in 2020, offering 55,000 square feet of space, a jump from the 26,000‑square‑foot old library.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18,
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
