      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ankeny%2C_Iowa",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Ankeny hosts 60 parks covering over 800 acres, including two aquatic centers, a dog park, and a disc golf course that attracts regional players.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
